.DS_Store
# Claude Code scratch and per-machine settings — with one exception below.
.claude/*
# `.claude/settings.json` carries the pre-migration backup hook. AGENTS.md
# describes that hook as a project mechanism, and a mechanism that lives only
# in an ignored file is a mechanism the next clone does not have: the hook was
# documented for nine days while being registered nowhere, and a migration
# reached production with no backup behind it. Committed so the documentation
# is true.
!.claude/settings.json

# Application data
.env

# Data
**/helf.json
**/helf.db
# WAL leaves -wal and -shm sidecars beside the database while the app is
# running; they are not matched by the pattern above.
**/helf.db-wal
**/helf.db-shm
**/*.db.bak
**/*.pre-alembic.bak
data/

